"Advanced option string to pass to the ingress queueing disciplines; no error"
" checking, use very carefully."
msgstr ""
"Avansert opsjonsstreng for å sende til disiplinene for ingress-kø; ingen "
"feilkontroll, bruk veldig forsiktig."

#: applications/luci-app-sqm/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/sqm.js:199
msgid ""
"Advanced options will only be used as long as this box is checked (only "
"needed if MTU > 1500)."
msgstr ""
"Avanserte alternativer vil bare bli brukt så lenge denne boksen er merket "
"(kun nødvendig hvis MTU > 1500)."

