#: applications/luci-app-sqm/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/sqm.js:83
msgid ""
"The SQM GUI has just enabled the sqm initscript on your behalf. Remember to "
"disable the sqm initscript manually under System Startup menu in case this "
"change was not wished for."
msgstr ""
"SQM GUI har nettopp aktivert sqm initscript på dine vegne. Husk å deaktivere"
" sqm initscript manuelt under System Startup-menyen i tilfelle denne "
"endringen ikke var ønsket."

#: applications/luci-app-sqm/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/sqm.js:48
msgid ""
"The SQM service seems to be disabled. Please use the button below to "
"activate this service."
msgstr ""
"SQM-tjenesten ser ut til å være deaktivert. Bruk knappen nedenfor for å "
"aktivere denne tjenesten."

#: applications/luci-app-sqm/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/sqm.js:96
msgid "Upload speed (egress)"
msgstr "Opplastingshastighet (utgående)"

#: applications/luci-app-sqm/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/sqm.js:96
msgid ""
"Upload speed (kbit/s) (egress) set to 0 to selectively disable egress "
